# A token that is exiled ceases to exist (CR 111.7): on turn 5 Bot1's Portable Hole exiles the Gold token Bot2 made when its Ornithopter attacked under its own Curse of Opulence (mana value 0, a nonland permanent). When Bot1 then exiles the
# Hole itself with Haywire Mite, the Gold token does not come back; Bot2's battlefield is the Mountain, the Curse and the Ornithopter.

